2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:07,640
So I told Carl nobody, no matter how famous their parents are, nobody is allowed to climb
所以我告訴卡爾沒有人，無論他們的父母多有名，任何人都不被允許攀爬

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:08,400
on the dinosaur.
在恐龍身上。

4
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,200
But of course, this went right in one ear.
當然，這正好傳到了一隻耳朵裡。

5
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,500
I love how he cares so much about stuff.
我喜歡他如此關心事物。

6
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:17,300
If I squint, I can pretend he's Alan Alda.
如果我瞇起眼睛，我可以假裝他是艾倫·阿爾達。

7
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,600
Oh good, another dinosaur story.
哦，太好了，又一個恐龍故事。

8
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,880
One of those is going to become extinct.
其中之一即將滅絕。

9
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:35,800
If I was a superhero who could fly and be invisible, that would be the best.
如果我是一個能飛又能隱身的超級英雄那就最好了。

10
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,000
What does Rachel see in this guy?
雷切爾在這個人身上看到了什麼？

11
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,700
I love Rachel.
我愛雷切爾。

12
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:53,300
I wish she was my wife.
我希望她是我的妻子。

13
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,520
Who's singing?
誰在唱歌？

14
00:01:56,940 --> 00:02:00,820
Hey, when you guys were kids and you played Happy Days, who were you?
嘿，當你們還是孩子的時候，你們玩快樂時光時，你們是誰？

15
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,760
I was always Richie.
我一直是裡奇。

16
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:03,000
I was always Joni.
我一直是喬尼。

17
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:07,240
Question, was Egg the Geller's the war cry of your neighborhood?
問題是，蓋勒埃格的口號是你家附近的戰爭口號嗎？

18
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:11,820
Ew, oh, it's the Mattress King.
呃，哦，這是床墊王。

19
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:14,400
Don't look, honey, change the channel, change the channel.
別看，親愛的，換頻道，換頻道。

20
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:14,700
Wait, wait.
等等，等等。

21
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:15,620
I want to see this.
我想看看這個。

22
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:18,840
After I divorce him, half of that kingdom is going to be mine.
等我跟他離婚之後，那個王國的一半就歸我了。

23
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,460
Despair fills the mattress showroom.
床墊陳列室裡充滿了絕望。

24
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:25,460
My kingdom is suddenly without a queen.
我的王國突然沒有女王了。

25
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,460
I'm so depressed.
我好鬱悶啊

26
00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:31,020
I'm going to slash my prices.
我要削減我的價格。

27
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,120
Check it out.
一探究竟。

28
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,260
$4.99 for a pillow top queen set.
加墊大床套裝 4.99 美元。

29
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,760
I'm going medieval on prices.
我對價格的看法是中世紀的。

30
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:40,060
What a wank.
真是手淫啊。

31
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:44,620
Oh, I cannot believe he's using our divorce to sell mattresses.
哦，我不敢相信他利用我們的離婚來賣床墊。

32
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,000
I know.
我知道。

33
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:49,200
At $4.99 for a pillow top queen set, who cares about the divorce?
一套加墊大床套裝售價 4.99 美元，誰在乎離婚呢？

34
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,800
Those babies will sell themselves.
那些嬰兒會賣掉自己。

35
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:55,780
And I'm appalled for you, by the way.
順便說一句，我為你感到震驚。

36
00:02:57,920 --> 00:03:00,880
I'm close, I'm cheap, I'm the king.
我很接近，我很便宜，我是國王。

37
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,540
He stuffs that codpiece, right?
他塞滿了密碼，對嗎？

38
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:08,700
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

39
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,840
Hey, here you go.
嘿，給你。

40
00:03:20,700 --> 00:03:21,920
Oh, you know what?
哦，你知道嗎？

41
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:24,120
I asked for no cinnamon on top.
我要求上面不要加肉桂。

42
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:25,200
Oh.
哦。

43
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,380
Yeah, okay.
是啊，好吧。

44
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,260
All right, Daddy, we'll see you tomorrow night.
好吧，爸爸，我們明天晚上見。

45
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,400
Okay, bye.
好的，再見。

46
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:37,500
We?
我們？

47
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:41,680
Are having dinner with my dad tomorrow night.
明天晚上和我爸爸一起吃晚餐。

48
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,200
I hope that's okay.
我希望沒關係。

49
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,300
Oh, shoot.
哦，射擊。

50
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,600
Tomorrow's not so good.
明天不太好。

51
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:50,380
I'm supposed to fall off the Empire State Building and land on a bicycle with no seat, so.
我應該從帝國大廈掉下來，然後騎在沒有座位的腳踏車上，所以。

52
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:55,640
Ross, my father doesn't hate you.
羅斯，我父親並不恨你。

53
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,840
Please, he refers to me as wet head.
拜託，他稱我為濕頭。

54
00:03:59,660 --> 00:04:01,860
Come on, honey, he calls everybody by a nickname.
來吧，親愛的，他用暱稱稱呼每個人。

55
00:04:02,540 --> 00:04:04,440
Okay, look, just one dinner, please.
好吧，聽著，請吃一頓晚餐。

56
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:05,920
One night for me, please.
請給我住一晚。

57
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:07,820
I just want him to love you like I do.
我只是想讓他像我一樣愛你。

58
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:11,500
All right, well, not exactly like I do, but.
好吧，好吧，不完全像我一樣，但是。

59
00:04:12,780 --> 00:04:17,260
But if you do come to dinner, I'll love you like I do and that black thing that you like.
但如果你真的來吃晚飯，我會像以前一樣愛你和你喜歡的那個黑色的東西。

60
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:19,460
I'll go.
我去吧。

61
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:24,740
Fine.
美好的。

62
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:25,780
Thank you.
謝謝。

63
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:30,980
Hi, Gunther.
嗨，岡瑟。

64
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,140
Yeah, we'll see.
是的，我們拭目以待。

65
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:36,960
Hey, you guys.
嘿，你們。

66
00:04:37,660 --> 00:04:38,320
Guess what?
你猜怎麼著？

67
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,140
I got a gig.
我得到了一份演出。

68
00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:44,600
See, that's why I can never be an actor, because I can't say gig.
看，這就是為什麼我永遠不能成為一名演員，因為我不能說“演出”。

69
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,940
Yeah, I can't say croissant.
是的，我不能說牛角麵包。

70
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:47,080
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

71
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:50,300
What's the part?
那是什麼部分？

72
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:51,760
Oh, it's not a part, no.
哦，這不是一部分，不是。

73
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:55,020
I'm teaching acting for soap operas down at the Learning Extension.
我在學習拓展中心教肥皂剧表演。

74
00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:56,100
Come on, that's great.
來吧，那太好了。

75
00:04:56,140 --> 00:05:00,480
Yeah, yeah, it's like, it's like my chance to give something back to the acting community.
是的，是的，這就像我有機會回饋演藝界。

76
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:04,560
You know, you're probably not allowed to sleep with any of your students.
你知道，你可能不被允許和你的任何學生睡覺。

77
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:10,520
I know.
我知道。

78
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,400
Ugh, I don't know, Monica.
呃，我不知道，莫妮卡。

79
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:20,020
It feels funny just being here.
光是待在這裡就覺得很有趣。

80
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:24,640
I mean, if you buy a bed from Janice's ex-husband, that's like betraying Chandler.
我的意思是，如果你從珍妮絲的前夫那裡買一張床，那就等於背叛了錢德勒。

81
00:05:24,980 --> 00:05:26,040
Not at these prices.
不是按照這些價格。

82
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:32,600
Hi.
你好。

83
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:34,540
You know, in England, you don't have to buy a bed.
你知道，在英國，你不必買床。

84
00:05:34,540 --> 00:05:36,540
This car would be on the other side of the store.
這輛車將在商店的另一邊。

85
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,720
Whoosh.
嗖嗖。

86
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,040
Oh.
哦。

87
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:46,340
Oh.
哦。

88
00:05:47,180 --> 00:05:47,360
Oh.
哦。

89
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:49,280
Phoebe, come here.
菲比，過來。

90
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:52,180
Oh, this is my new bed.
哦，這是我的新床。

91
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:53,880
You gotta feel this bad boy.
你一定要感受一下這個壞男孩。

92
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:58,260
Ugh, Monica, it still feels so weird, you know?
呃，莫妮卡，還是覺得很奇怪，你知道嗎？

93
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,600
Chandler's your friend.
錢德勒是你的朋友。

94
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,000
Oh.
哦。

95
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:02,080
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

96
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:03,920
Ugh.
啊。

97
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,720
All right, take this bed.
好吧，就這張床吧。

98
00:06:05,780 --> 00:06:06,700
You can make other friends.
你可以結交其他朋友。

99
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,060
Good evening.
晚上好。

100
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,700
I am Mr. Tribbiani.
我是特里比亞尼先生。

101
00:06:21,020 --> 00:06:23,440
And I'll be teaching acting for soap operas.
我將教授肥皂剧表演。

102
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:28,100
Unfortunately, tonight will be my only class because
不幸的是，今晚將是我唯一的課，因為

103
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:31,440
due to a rare blood disease, I only have two weeks to live.
由於一種罕見的血液疾病，我只剩下兩週的生命了。

104
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:34,320
So, do we get our deposit back?
那我們的押金能拿回來嗎？

105
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:38,260
I'm supposed to be an example of acting for soap operas.
我應該成為肥皂剧表演的榜樣。

106
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:40,500
Then why are you only teaching tonight?
那你為什麼只在今晚教課？

107
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,740
I'm not.
我不是。

108
00:06:43,940 --> 00:06:45,700
Look, why don't we get straight to the lesson, okay?
聽著，我們為什麼不直接上課，好嗎？

109
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:46,320
All right.
好的。

110
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:52,960
Now, um, on my first day as Dr. Drake Remore on Days of Our Lives,
現在，嗯，在我在《我們的日子》中飾演 Drake Remore 博士的第一天，

111
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:59,740
uh, I learned that one of the most important things
呃，我瞭解到最重要的事情之一

112
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:02,780
in soap opera acting is re-acting.
在肥皂剧中，表演就是重新表演。

113
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:04,880
This does not mean acting again.
這並不意味著再次行動。

114
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:10,660
It means you don't have a line, but someone else just did.
這意味著您沒有排隊，但其他人已經排隊了。

115
00:07:10,780 --> 00:07:11,720
And it goes something like this.
事情是這樣的。

116
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,380
Thanks. Thanks. Thanks a lot.
謝謝。謝謝。多謝。

117
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:22,700
Oh, by the way, before I forget,
哦，順便說一下，在我忘記之前，

118
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,600
to work in soap operas,
從事肥皂剧工作，

119
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,820
some of you are gonna have to become much more attractive.
你們中的一些人必須變得更加有吸引力。

120
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,300
All right. Moving right along.
好的。向右移動。

121
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:35,160
Hi.
你好。

122
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:36,180
Hey.
嘿。

123
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:38,160
Oh, how was teaching last night?
哦，昨晚的教學怎麼樣？

124
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,020
Oh, it was great.
哦，太棒了。

125
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,440
Yeah, you get to say stuff like,
是的，你可以說這樣的話，

126
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,860
hey, the bell doesn't dismiss you.
嘿，鈴聲不會解僱你。

127
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,300
I dismiss you.
我解僱了你。

128
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,160
Oh, nice.
哦，不錯。

129
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:48,600
Oh, and guess what?
哦，你猜怎麼著？

130
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,420
I got an audition for All My Children.
我參加了《我所有的孩子》的試鏡。

131
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:51,180
Oh, yay!
哦，耶！

132
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:54,080
Yeah, it's this great part, this boxer named Nick,
是的，這是一個偉大的部分，這個名叫尼克的拳擊手，

133
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,040
and I'm so, so right for it, you know?
我非常非常適合，你知道嗎？

134
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:56,880
He's just like me.
他就像我一樣。

135
00:07:57,260 --> 00:08:00,720
Except, like, he's a boxer and has an evil twin.
只不過，他是一名拳擊手，並且有一個邪惡的雙胞胎。

136
00:08:02,340 --> 00:08:02,760
Oh.
哦。

137
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,740
Dum-da-da-dum.
咚咚咚。

138
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,420
Hey, hey, hey, hey.
嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。

139
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,260
Delivery from the mattress cave.
從床墊洞穴運送。

140
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,500
You, Miss Geller?
你，蓋勒小姐？

141
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:15,820
Okay.
好的。

142
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:16,620
Sign here.
在這裡簽名。

143
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:19,720
Ooh, do I have a middle name?
哦，我有中間名嗎？

144
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:23,800
All right, Monica Falula...
好吧，莫妮卡·法魯拉…

145
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:24,960
Geller.
蓋勒。

146
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,960
It's that bedroom there.
就是那間臥室。

147
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:30,140
Thank you.
謝謝。

148
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:33,600
Hey, Monica bought a bed from the Mattress King?
嘿，莫妮卡從床墊王那裡買了一張床？

149
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:34,100
Yeah.
是的。

150
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:37,160
So please, please, please don't say anything to Chandler.
所以拜託拜託拜託不要對錢德勒說任何話。

151
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:39,040
You want me to lie to Chandler?
你想讓我對錢德勒撒謊嗎？

152
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,220
Is that a problem?
這是一個問題嗎？

153
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:40,640
No.
不。

154
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:44,520
Oh, hey, hey, Nick the boxer.
哦，嘿，嘿，拳擊手尼克。

155
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:45,540
Let's see what you got.
讓我們看看你得到了什麼。

156
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:46,800
All right, yeah, put them up.
好吧，是的，把它們放上來。

157
00:08:46,940 --> 00:08:47,280
Come on.
快點。

158
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:50,120
Hey, you're, uh, you're pretty good at this.
嘿，你，呃，你在這方面很擅長。

159
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,440
Yeah, well, I had to learn.
是的，好吧，我必須學習。

160
00:08:51,540 --> 00:08:52,480
I was staying at the Y,
我住在Y，

161
00:08:52,620 --> 00:08:54,780
and some of the young men weren't acting Christian enough.
有些年輕人表現得不夠基督徒。

162
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:55,300
Oh.
哦。

163
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,160
Hey, now.
嘿，現在。

164
00:08:59,560 --> 00:08:59,920
Hey!
嘿！

165
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:01,380
Ow!
噢！

166
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:02,720
And I'm bleeding.
我在流血。

167
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:03,080
Oh, oh!
哦，哦！

168
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,800
Okay, great.
好的，太好了。

169
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,420
Wow, and I'm a vegetarian.
哇，我是素食主義者。

170
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:09,400
All right, all right, I'm sorry.
好吧好吧，對不起。

171
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:10,380
We'll put some ice on it.
我們會在上面放一些冰。

172
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:10,560
Okay.
好的。

173
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,360
Put your head back.
把頭向後仰。

174
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:11,740
All right.
好的。

175
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:13,240
I can't see.
我看不到。

176
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:14,060
All right, I'll have you.
好吧，我會擁有你的。

177
00:09:14,340 --> 00:09:15,060
Oh, God.
哦，上帝。

178
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:18,980
Which bedroom do you want it in, Miss Geller?
蓋勒小姐，你想把它放在哪間臥室？

179
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:22,700
Oh, um, it's the compulsively neat one by the window, okay?
哦，嗯，就是靠窗的那個，太整潔了，好嗎？

180
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:23,620
Yeah, sure.
是的，當然。

181
00:09:27,620 --> 00:09:32,260
Hi, Daddy.
嗨，爸爸。

182
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:34,760
This is where they put us?
這就是他們把我們安置在哪裡？

183
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,300
What, there was no table available in the kitchen?
什麼，廚房裡沒有桌子？

184
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:40,160
Hello, baby.
你好，寶貝。

185
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:41,380
You remember Ross?
你還記得羅斯嗎？

186
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:41,820
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

187
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,260
Nice to see you again, Dr. Green.
很高興再次見到你，格林博士。

188
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:45,700
So...
所以...

189
00:09:51,060 --> 00:09:52,100
How's the library?
圖書館怎麼樣？

190
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:53,620
Uh, museum.
呃，博物館。

191
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,540
What happened to the library?
圖書館怎麼了？

192
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,340
There never was a library.
從來沒有圖書館。

193
00:09:57,940 --> 00:09:59,300
I mean, there are libraries.
我的意思是，有圖書館。

194
00:09:59,540 --> 00:10:01,860
It's just that I, um, I've never worked at one.
只是我，嗯，我從來沒有工作過。

195
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,280
You know what's really good here?
你知道這裡有什麼真正的好處嗎？

196
00:10:08,140 --> 00:10:08,860
The lobster.
龍蝦。

197
00:10:09,100 --> 00:10:09,340
Mmm.
嗯。

198
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:10,400
What do you say?
你怎麼說？

199
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,460
Shall I just order three?
Shall I just order three?

200
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:12,800
Yeah, if you're really hungry.
是的，如果你真的餓了。

201
00:10:18,420 --> 00:10:19,160
It was a joke.
這是一個笑話。

202
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:19,840
I made a joke.
我開了個玩笑。

203
00:10:21,860 --> 00:10:24,800
Yeah, actually, Daddy, Ross is allergic to lobster.
是的，事實上，爸爸，羅斯對龍蝦過敏。

204
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:26,640
What kind of person is allergic to lobster?
什麼樣的人對龍蝦過敏？

205
00:10:26,820 --> 00:10:28,380
I guess the kind of person that works in a library.
我猜是那種在圖書館工作的人。

206
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:30,260
It's not a library.
這不是圖書館。

207
00:10:30,260 --> 00:10:31,480
I know, it's a museum.
我知道，這是一座博物館。

208
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:33,440
Well, you're the only one around here who can make a joke.
好吧，你是這裡唯一會開玩笑的人。

209
00:10:33,540 --> 00:10:34,320
At least mine was funny.
至少我的很有趣。

210
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,620
Uh, waiter.
呃，服務生。

211
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:39,260
We will have two lobsters and a menu.
我們要兩隻龍蝦和一份選單。

212
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,900
So, Dr. Green, how's the old boat?
那麼，格林博士，那艘舊船怎麼樣了呢？

213
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:47,320
They found rust.
他們發現了鐵鏽。

214
00:10:48,300 --> 00:10:49,800
You know what rust does to a boat?
你知道生鏽對船有什麼影響嗎？

215
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:52,000
Gives it a nice antique-y look?
給它一個漂亮的古董外觀嗎？

216
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:00,200
Rust is boat cancer, Ross.
羅斯，銹病是船癌。

217
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:02,180
Wow, I'm sorry.
哇，對不起。

218
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:04,740
When I was a kid, I lost a bike to that.
當我還是個孩子的時候，我就因此失去了一輛腳踏車。

219
00:11:11,260 --> 00:11:12,380
Excuse me for a moment.
請原諒我一下。

220
00:11:12,460 --> 00:11:12,960
Will you please?
請你好嗎？

221
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:15,160
I want to say goodnight to the Levines before we go.
在我們離開之前我想向萊文夫婦道晚安。

222
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:15,360
Okay.
好的。

223
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,320
Honey, stop.
親愛的，停下來。

224
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,580
It's not that bad.
沒那麼糟。

225
00:11:22,780 --> 00:11:23,020
Yeah.
是的。

226
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:23,740
Oh.
哦。

227
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:25,140
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

228
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,320
I think your dad must have added wrong.
我想你爸爸肯定加錯了。

229
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,980
He only tipped, like, four percent.
他只給了百分之四的小費。

230
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:29,620
Yeah.
是的。

231
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:30,940
That's Daddy.
那是爸爸。

232
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:32,440
That's Daddy?
那是爸爸？

233
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:35,020
What, doesn't it bother you?
什麼，這不困擾你嗎？

234
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:35,880
You're a waitress.
你是一名女服務生。

235
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,760
Yes, it bothers me, Ross.
是的，這讓我很困擾，羅斯。

236
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:40,100
But, you know, if he was a regular at the coffee house,
但是，你知道，如果他是咖啡館的常客，

237
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,360
I'd be serving him sneezers.
我會給他打噴嚏。

238
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:43,480
So?
所以？

239
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:47,020
So, Ross, I bugged him about this a million times.
所以，羅斯，我為此騷擾了他一百萬次。

240
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,080
He's not going to change.
他不會改變。

241
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,480
Do you really serve people sneezers?
你真的為人們提供打噴嚏服務嗎？

242
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:54,020
Well, um, I don't.
嗯，嗯，我不知道。

243
00:11:55,220 --> 00:11:56,280
All right, kids, ready?
好了，孩子們，準備好了嗎？

244
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:57,140
Yes.
是的。

245
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:58,640
Thanks again, Dr. Green.
再次感謝，格林博士。

246
00:11:58,800 --> 00:11:59,200
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

247
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:06,020
Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait.
噢，等等，等等，等等，等等。

248
00:12:06,700 --> 00:12:07,840
I think I forgot my receipt.
我想我忘記了收據。

249
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:09,140
Oh, no, you don't need that.
哦，不，你不需要那個。

250
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:09,660
Why not?
為什麼不呢？

251
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,040
The carbon, it's messy.
碳，很亂。

252
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:13,500
I mean, it gets on your fingers and causes the,
我的意思是，它沾到你的手指會導致，

253
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:15,260
the, uh, night blindness.
呃，夜盲症。

254
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:19,720
What is this?
這是什麼？

255
00:12:20,900 --> 00:12:22,180
Who put a 20 down there?
誰在那裡放了20？

256
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,260
Huh?
啊？

257
00:12:23,420 --> 00:12:25,040
Oh, yeah, that would be me.
哦，是的，那就是我。

258
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,620
Um, I have, I have a problem.
嗯，我有，我有一個問題。

259
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:29,180
I, I tip way too much.
我，我給的小費太多了。

260
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:30,120
Way, way too much.
方式，太多了。

261
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:31,000
It's a sickness, really.
這確實是一種病。

262
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:32,140
Yeah, it is.
是的，確實如此。

263
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:32,460
It is.
這是。

264
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:33,640
We really, really have to do something about it.
我們真的、真的必須為此做些什麼。

265
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:33,900
Oh, no.
哦，不。

266
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:34,580
Excuse me.
打擾一下。

267
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,460
You think I'm cheap?
你覺得我佔便宜嗎？

268
00:12:37,660 --> 00:12:39,820
Oh, Dad, you know, he didn't mean anything by that.
哦，爸爸，你知道，他這麼說並沒有什麼意思。

269
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,060
He really didn't.
他確實沒有。

270
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:42,820
Nothing I do means anything, really.
我所做的一切都沒有任何意義，真的。

271
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:46,740
This is nice.
這很好。

272
00:12:47,020 --> 00:12:49,700
I pay $200 for dinner, you put down 20,
我付了200美元的晚餐，你付了20美元，

273
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:51,700
and you come out looking like Mr. Bigshot.
你出來的時候看起來就像大人物先生。

274
00:12:52,220 --> 00:12:53,500
You really want to be Mr. Bigshot?
你真的想成為大人物先生嗎？

275
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:53,860
Oh.
哦。

276
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:55,240
Here, I'll tell you what.
在這裡，我會告訴你什麼。

277
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:57,840
You pay the whole bill, Mr. Bigshot, all right?
大人物先生，你付全部帳單，好嗎？

278
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,880
Well, Mr. Bigshot is better than wet head.
好吧，大人物先生比濕漉漉的腦袋好。

279
00:13:06,300 --> 00:13:08,440
Okay, some tricks of the trade.
好吧，一些交易技巧。

280
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,380
Now, I've never been able to cry as an actor,
現在，身為演員我從來沒有哭過，

281
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,740
so if I'm in a scene where I have to cry,
所以如果我在一個不得不哭的場景中

282
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:15,620
I cut a hole in my pocket,
我在口袋裡割了一個洞

283
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:17,740
take a pair of tweezers,
拿一把鑷子，

284
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:20,060
and just start pulling.
然後開始拉。

285
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:23,580
Okay?
好的？

286
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:26,580
Or, uh, or let's say I want to convey
或者，呃，或者說我想傳達

287
00:13:26,580 --> 00:13:29,100
that I've, uh, just done something evil.
我，呃，剛剛做了一些邪惡的事情。

288
00:13:29,660 --> 00:13:31,080
Well, that would be your basic,
嗯，這就是你的基本，

289
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:33,660
I've got a fishhook in my eyebrow and I like it.
我眉毛上有一個魚鉤，我喜歡它。

290
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:38,640
Yeah? Okay.
是的？好的。

291
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:41,300
Let's say I've just gotten bad news.
假設我剛剛得到壞訊息。

292
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:45,800
Well, all I do there is try and divide 232 by 13.
好吧，我所做的就是嘗試將 232 除以 13。

293
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:56,780
And that's how it's done.
事情就是這樣完成的。

294
00:13:57,340 --> 00:13:59,460
Great soap opera acting tonight, everybody.
今晚肥皂剧表演很棒，大家。

295
00:14:00,020 --> 00:14:00,760
Class dismissed.
下課了。

296
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:04,680
Hey, Mr. Trim.
嘿，特里姆先生。

297
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:05,180
Hey.
嘿。

298
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:06,140
Guess what?
你猜怎麼著？

299
00:14:06,620 --> 00:14:07,640
I got an audition.
我參加了試鏡。

300
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:08,220
Oh?
哦？

301
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:10,200
One of my students got an audition.
我的一位學生參加了試鏡。

302
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,200
I'm so proud.
我很自豪。

303
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:15,320
I was wondering if you would consider coaching me for it.
我想知道你是否會考慮指導我。

304
00:14:15,580 --> 00:14:16,520
You bet.
你打賭。

305
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,340
What's the part?
那是什麼部分？

306
00:14:17,540 --> 00:14:18,400
Oh, it's great.
哦，太棒了。

307
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:20,980
It's a role in All My Children, Nick the Boxer.
這是《我的孩子們》中的一個角色，拳擊手尼克。

308
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:30,420
You had to do it, didn't you?
你必須這麼做，不是嗎？

309
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:31,480
You couldn't just leave it alone.
你不能就這樣不管它。

310
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:33,080
Four percent, okay?
百分之四，可以嗎？

311
00:14:33,140 --> 00:14:35,300
I tip more than that when there's a bug in my food.
當我的食物裡有蟲時，我給的小費會比這個多。

312
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:39,580
Ross, tonight was about the two of you getting along.
羅斯，今晚是你們兩個相處的日子。

313
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:40,180
Ugh.
啊。

314
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:42,440
Ugh, would you just see my chiropractor already?
呃，你能見見我的脊椎按摩師嗎？

315
00:14:42,820 --> 00:14:44,080
Yeah, I'm going to go to a doctor
是的，我要去看醫生

316
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,680
who went to medical school at a mini mall.
誰在迷你商場上過醫學院。

317
00:14:51,180 --> 00:14:51,900
Hey, Pheebs.
嘿，菲比斯。

318
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,060
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

319
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:55,360
I'm freaking out!
我嚇壞了！

320
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,000
Monica kind of trusted me with something
莫妮卡在某件事上信任了我

321
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,940
and she shouldn't have.
她不應該這樣做。

322
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:03,900
All right, I haven't lived here in a while,
好吧，我有一段時間沒在這裡住了，

323
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:04,840
so I have to ask you something.
所以我得問你一件事。

324
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:07,480
Does Monica still turn the lights on in her bedroom?
莫妮卡還開著臥室的燈嗎？

325
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:10,160
Yeah.
是的。

326
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:11,880
I am so dead.
我就這麼死了。

327
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:16,520
All right, look, here's the bottom line, Ross.
好吧，看，這就是底線，羅斯。

328
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:18,860
This is fixable if we act fast, okay?
如果我們行動迅速，這個問題是可以解決的，好嗎？

329
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,580
So I'll invite him to brunch tomorrow
所以明天我會邀請他吃早午餐

330
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:21,640
and you can make nice.
你可以和善。

331
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,300
Honey, I have tried to make nice.
親愛的，我已經盡力表現得友善了。

332
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:25,280
It doesn't work.
這不起作用。

333
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:28,020
Okay, look, Ross, I realize that my father is difficult,
好吧，聽著，羅斯，我意識到我父親很難相處，

334
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:31,040
but that's why you have got to be the bigger man here.
但這就是為什麼你必須成為這裡的大人物。

335
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:33,760
Look, sweetie, I could be the bigger man.
聽著，親愛的，我可以成為更大的人。

336
00:15:33,980 --> 00:15:35,560
I could be the biggest man.
我可以成為最大的男人。

337
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:37,960
I could be a big, huge, giant man
我可以成為一個高大、巨大、巨人的男人

338
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,400
and it still wouldn't make any difference,
但這仍然沒有任何區別

339
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:41,180
except that I could pick your father up
除了我可以去接你父親

340
00:15:41,180 --> 00:15:43,520
and say, like me, like me, tiny doctor!
並說，像我一樣，像我一樣，小醫生！

341
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:48,040
Okay, well, can't you just try it one more time, Ross?
好吧，羅斯，你就不能再試一次嗎？

342
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,340
For me, for me.
為了我，為了我。

343
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:51,920
Rachel, one brunch is not going to solve anything.
雷切爾，一頓早午餐解決不了任何問題。

344
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,280
You've got to face it, okay?
你必須面對它，好嗎？

345
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:54,700
We're never going to get along.
我們永遠合不來。

346
00:15:54,860 --> 00:15:57,260
Okay, well, you are just going to have to, okay?
好吧，好吧，你必須這樣做，好嗎？

347
00:15:57,340 --> 00:15:59,360
Because I've already got a mother and a father
因為我已經有爸爸媽媽了

348
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,120
who cannot stay in the same room together, okay?
誰不能一起待在同一個房間，好嗎？

349
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:02,960
I don't want to have to have a separate room for you, too.
我也不想給你一個單獨的房間。

350
00:16:03,140 --> 00:16:03,980
Okay, okay, okay.
好吧，好吧，好吧。

351
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,840
I'll get the bagels.
我去拿百吉餅。

352
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,160
What's this?
